  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dt>Description</dt>\n<dd>This template is used to create a basic navigation box.</dd>\n<dt>Syntax</dt>\n<dd>Type <code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Navbox\" title=\"Template:Navbox\">navbox</a>&#124;<font color=\"gray\"><i>&lt;...&gt;</i></font>}}</code> somewhere, with parameters as shown below.</dd>\n<dt>Sample output</dt></dl>\n<pre>{{navbox\n|header=Land of Bob\n|body=This [[place]] and that [[place]].\n}}</pre>\n<p>Results in...\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px\"><table class=\"nowraplinks navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit\"></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205359\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 196/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 651/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 78/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 87/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639723/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.661      1 -total\n 84.00%   21.554      1 Template:Navbox\n 15.52%    3.982      1 Template:T\n  7.59%    1.948     20 Template:T/piece\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:74-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205359 and revision id 74. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
